  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A muon of proper lifetime <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> is produced in the high atmosphere and travels towards Earth at a relativistic speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. What is the distance travelled by the muon in the reference frame of Earth?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"vt\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"vt1-\\frac{v^{2}}{c^{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"vt\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^{2}}{c^{2}}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{vt}{\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^{2}}{c^{2}}}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
